      "time": "~35s",
      "narrative": "Now I can see the agent operate and review how it works. \n\nI can review a flagged invoice, open the evidence trail behind every recommendation, and act — approve a recovery, place it on hold, or escalate for governance. \n\nThat's the first proof: the invoice review flow works, right here, locally. ",
      "demo_actions": "Walk through the invoice result in the Canvas. Show the recommendation, supporting evidence, and the available actions such as approve, hold, or escalate.",
